<!--
  I18N-1 Task 7 locked vocabulary (spec §7.2) - see docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-11-i18n-1-owner-review.md
  for the full owner-review table. This file holds TWO classes:

  Class A - locked, NEVER translated: carries translatable="false". Must not appear in values-ru or
  values-tr (LocaleCompletenessGuardTest rejects a translatable="false" key that shows up in a
  translated folder). Exactly one entry: the provenance frame (DS-6B invariant - a prayer surface
  always states where its times came from). Extracted verbatim from
  PrayerDetailScreen.kt's toProvenanceText() ("local calculation · <method> · <madhab>", lowercase as
  originally authored - NOT the "LOCAL CALC" abbreviation used elsewhere in the app).

  Class B - locked, but IS translated (values-ru / values-tr carry the same keys, same as any other
  string): prayer names, calculation-method names, and Asr madhab labels. These live here (not in
  strings.xml) only so a change lands in the owner-review package before it ships - Turkish uses
  Diyanet terminology, Russian uses the transliteration already in use in Russian-language Islamic
  sources, and this is religious terminology the owner reviews specifically.

  - Prayer names (6, matching domain.prayer.PrayerName - SUNRISE is not one of the five daily prayers
    but is still a named row on the detail screen, spec §3): the Turkish and Russian values are the
    EXACT terms given by the task brief, copied verbatim (not retyped) - not a draft.
  - Calculation-method names (11, matching domain.prayer.SupportedPrayerMethods.ALL - domain stays
    Android-resource-free per CLAUDE.md, so these are re-hosted here as the presentation-layer source
    of truth; domain's displayLabel field is untouched and still used by feature/launcher, which this
    task does not touch): English copied verbatim from SupportedPrayerMethods.kt. The Turkish/Russian
    values are a DRAFT translation - not given by the brief - awaiting owner sign-off.
  - Asr madhab labels (2, matching domain.prayer.Madhab): English copied verbatim from the existing
    madhabLabel() functions. The Turkish/Russian values are a DRAFT translation awaiting owner sign-off.
-->
